{
  "message": "The references shown offer a starting point, but the trailer storyboard does not advance the playable goal. Mia has joined, but her unknown hours mean you cannot yet count on her for co-op. Before approving, replace the trailer task with a small sailing prototype and add a player test. We’ll review the first sprint together; I look forward to your build and devlog posts ;).",
  "tasks": [
    {
      "itemId": "cmvu2xzlc00jx4gz82d69s8nh",
      "kind": "offGoal",
      "note": "Replace it with a rough sailing build in one area with a tide cycle: a trailer storyboard would not test the core mechanic.",
      "suggestion": null
    }
  ],
  "add": [
    "Have five players try the sailing prototype and record whether tides change their decisions in a shared test report."
  ],
  "goal": {
    "fit": "narrow",
    "note": "With no playable build shown, two islands and co-op are too much to commit within 40–60 confirmed hours, a common mismatch you can fix here. Use: “A rough playable sailing prototype in one area with a tide cycle, tested by five players, with findings in a shared report.”",
    "stage": {
      "inside": true,
      "note": ""
    }
  }
}

